                <p>One impossible challenge, a full squad, and a final round nobody can forget.</p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="video-card">
              <div class="thumb two">
                <span class="play-badge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="video-info">
                <div class="tag-row">
                  <span class="tag">Vlog</span>
                  <span class="tag">9 min</span>
                </div>
                <h4>Behind the Stream</h4>
                <p>See the chaos, the setup, and the funny moments before the live cameras roll.</p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="video-card">
              <div class="thumb three">
                <span class="play-badge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="video-info">
                <div class="tag-row">
                  <span class="tag">Challenge</span>
                  <span class="tag">15 min</span>
                </div>
                <h4>1000 Shots Challenge</h4>
                <p>A wild streak of luck, skill, and pure adrenaline that kept the chat exploding.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="community">
        <div class="container split">
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
              <h3>Community power</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="community-box">
              <div class="mini-card">
                <span>Discord members</span>
                <strong>118K</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-card">
                <span>Fan art posts</span>
                <strong>32K</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-card">
                <span>Uplifted streams</span>
                <strong>89%</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="mini-card">
                <span>Fan reaction rate</span>
                <strong>99%</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
